OL,5,G2200 Beverley's World of Music
OL,6,     FThe finest musical melodies,
OL,7,     Fexquisite performances from stage
OL,8,     Fand screen, and orchestral and
OL,9,     Fchoral works from Wales and the
OL,10,     Fworld. There's no need to book
OL,11,     Fyour seat, just listen and relax.
OL,12,G0100 The Welsh Roots of Country
OL,13,     FWhen Al Lewis travelled to
OL,14,     FNashville in 2012 to record an
OL,15,     Falbum, he discovered that the
OL,16,     FWelsh have played a far greater
OL,17,     Frole in shaping country and
OL,18,     FAmericana music than many realise.
